In a #large pot{} of salted boiling water, cook @Macaroni{8%oz} according to package directions until al dente. Drain and return to pot.

In a #large skillet{} over medium-high heat, melt @butter{2%tbsp}. Stir in @garlic{3%tsp}(minced) until fragrant, about ~{2%minutes}. Sprinkle @all-purpose flour{2%tbsp} over butter and stir until thickened. Gradually whisk in @heavy cream{2 1/2%c}(or half-and-half) until smooth.

Season with @salt{} and @ground black pepper{} to taste, and add @Italian seasoning{1%tsp}. Stir in @shredded Italian blend cheese{1/2%c} until melted, then add pasta to skillet and stir to combine.

Add @roasted red peppers{1%12oz jar}(drained and chopped), @baby spinach leaves{1%c}(packed), and @diced mushrooms{1/3%cup}. Stir until spinach is tender. Add more @salt{} and @ground black pepper{} if needed. Serve immediately.